00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:30.620
And we have 10,000 customers.

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:34.440
In other cases, it wasn't
where they were located.

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:39.850
And this Fabric allowed them
to connect seamlessly to it.

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:44.660
Now in certain locations--
and I'll say today it's eight,

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:46.540
and you can see Hong
Kong has an asterisk

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:48.520
