your own infrastructure.

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:10.810
So you get the benefits.

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:13.420
And I've personally spoken
with [INAUDIBLE] about this,

00:15:13.420 --> 00:15:17.540
is that when you think
about workloads residing,

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:20.440
and the power of Google in
particular when you think

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:24.070
