00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:33.040
If you don't want
your data there,

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:36.790
you can have your
data on your premise

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:39.610
and actually use the
applications and tools

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:44.770
