over that Fabric.

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:48.130
This is significant
and gives, really,

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:49.840
the best of both worlds.

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:53.740
And we've seen several
companies, organizations,

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:58.330
